          mul_nonneg (mul_nonneg hK hP) hΨ', mul_nonneg (mul_nonneg hK hc') hQ]
      · intro A Cd' m' cN' q q' ε Φr Φρ D K X hA hq' hCd' hm' hcN' hq hε hΦ hK hX h1 h2
        subst hA hq'
